Package: stBoot
Type: Package
Title: Bootstrap Classification Confidence for Spatial Cell-Type Analysis
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: person("Shreya", "Rao", email = "shreya.rajeshrao@sydney.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Cell type labels in spatial single-cell data are
    uncertain, particularly between closely related subtypes. stBoot estimates
    a per-cell classification confidence by bootstrapping (multinomial
    resampling of each cell's counts followed by re-classification) and uses
    the resulting confidences as soft cell type weights. The weights are
    propagated through downstream analyses: cell type proportions, the
    co-localisation statistics and niche identification, each compared to
    the same analysis using hard labels. Cell types are organised with a user-supplied hierarchy of
    lineages, groups and subtypes. Helpers for testing against sample-level
    outcomes and for plotting are included.
